title: "Precision Onco Africa: offline multi-agent platform for TP53 variant interpretation"
abstract: "Offline-capable, privacy-preserving multi-agent LLM platform for TP53 variant interpretation in precision oncology, with an AI reasoning-audit layer and a ClinVar/IARC benchmark. Designed to run on 8 GB RAM in low-resource clinical settings."
